---
import PolicyLayout from "../../components/PolicyLayout.astro";
---

<PolicyLayout
  title="Return and Refund Policy | VIRELLAART"
  description="Review VIRELLAART return, cancellation and refund conditions for made-to-order and customized luxury furniture."
>
  <p>
    VIRELLAART furniture is generally produced or prepared according to the
    confirmed order. Customers should carefully review product details,
    dimensions, selected options, prices and delivery conditions before
    approving an order.
  </p>

  <h2>Made-to-Order Furniture</h2>

  <p>
    Furniture produced after order confirmation may not be eligible for return
    or cancellation once production has started. This especially applies to
    customized products, selected fabrics, special finishes, modified
    dimensions and project-specific configurations.
  </p>

  <h2>Order Cancellation</h2>

  <p>
    Cancellation requests must be submitted in writing as soon as possible.
    Eligibility for cancellation and any applicable deduction will depend on
    the production stage, materials already ordered and work already completed.
  </p>

  <h2>Customized Products</h2>

  <p>
    Products manufactured according to customer-approved specifications cannot
    normally be returned because of a change of preference after production has
    begun.
  </p>

  <ul>
    <li>Customer-selected fabrics or upholstery</li>
    <li>Special colors, finishes or decorative details</li>
    <li>Modified measurements or configurations</li>
    <li>Project-specific or personalized production</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Incorrect or Damaged Products</h2>

  <p>
    If a product arrives with confirmed transportation damage, a manufacturing
    issue or a material difference from the approved order, the customer should
    contact VIRELLAART promptly.
  </p>

  <p>
    Photographs, videos and relevant delivery documents may be requested so
    that the issue can be reviewed accurately.
  </p>

  <p>
    After reviewing the information, VIRELLAART may offer an appropriate
    solution such as technical assistance, replacement of an affected part,
    repair coordination or another mutually agreed resolution.
  </p>

  <h2>Refund Processing</h2>

  <p>
    When a refund is approved in writing, the method and processing period will
    be communicated to the customer.
  </p>

  <p>
    Bank charges, payment-provider deductions, completed production expenses
    and transportation costs may be deducted when applicable.
  </p>

  <h2>Contact Our Team</h2>

  <p>
    Every order is reviewed individually. Contact VIRELLAART before confirming
    your purchase to receive clear information about production, cancellation,
    return and delivery conditions for your selected collection.
  </p>
</PolicyLayout>